{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500510/extras/aa089e606fb544035edcd8c4ea215e82.poster.avif?t=1771497367\" width=620 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500510/extras/aa089e606fb544035edcd8c4ea215e82.webm?t=1771497367\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6 The return of a 2D fighting game featuring intense battles between restaurant industry heroines!  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The heroines, dressed in stylish uniforms, unleash a variety of attacks, including strikes, throws, and projectile moves. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master spacing with dashes and backsteps, and turn the tide of battle with powerful &quot;Super Moves&quot;, which can only be executed when low on health. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use every technique at your disposal to defeat your rivals!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game modes include: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Normal Mode&quot;, where players enter a tournament with their favorite character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Story Mode&quot;, featuring dramatic developments through rich anime and visual scenes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;VS Mode&quot;, allowing for 2P battles and CPU matches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6 Saturn Tribute enhances the experience with powerful support features! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Rewind&quot; function, allowing players to retry past moments after mistakes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Save &amp; Load&quot; function, making it easy to revisit favorite scenes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional features:  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;command list guide&quot; displayed on the side of the screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;one-button Super Move system&quot;, allowing automatic input of complex commands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>\u203b While the in-game menu supports &quot;Japanese and English&quot;, some in-game text and voiceovers remain &quot;Japanese only&quot;.</u></i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6What is &quot;ADVANCED V.G.&quot;?  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;V.G.&quot; is a fighting game series that began with its first PC release in 1993. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game gained popularity due to its unique concept of waitress fighters, simple yet strategic controls, and visually striking heroines.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This version is based on the 1997 home console release, with additional new features added for a modern experience.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Yuka Takeuchi","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3500510/49d42b394d9675857c526e6b5c7e6d2a34c1c9c7.jpg"},{"name":"Chiho Masuda","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3500510/560aabcf2d77d787f94d43e2bd2b019562a736ce.jpg"},{"name":"Manami Kusunoki","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3500510/17ef43aedf8785abf7bbf8b81da0c98d94aeb9e0.jpg"},{"name":"Jun Kubota","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3500510/817a57dd10e19b344cff1fa707ae1c23efce96df.jpg"},{"name":"Satomi Yajima","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3500510/374547ae155f4610c8d7072a4f37f3cacbe52f97.jpg"},{"name":"Ayako Yuki","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3500510/93b567802b7ca968337af0825ad195c995f5546d.jpg"},{"name":"Elirin (Eleanor Goldsmith)","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3500510/15487191ebd2f28350a9ca05147e9bd48730d13e.jpg"},{"name":"Kaori Yanase","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3500510/7e8235568c296a166ae0281c7897171734743cad.jpg"},{"name":"Reimi Jahana","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3500510/9e26c733174adcd24b0ca7703524380d42880b52.jpg"},{"name":"Variable Geo","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3500510/f940e09e642371886e64c8b67fb111cb7f64930c.jpg"}],"total":13},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3500510?t=1771497367","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500510/5f15e6ef2bb9f6f94daa94b7c1a600ac16173b0d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771497367","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500510/ac3041003224caef24647ccfb49932c2671a598a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771497367","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500510/ac3041003224caef24647ccfb49932c2671a598a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771497367","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2,5],"notes":"This game contains blood.\r\nThis game contains gunfire.\r\nThis game contains Partial Nudity.\r\nThis game does not contain sexual acts."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" post